Source: sysible-platform-apps
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sysible <maintainers@sysible.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://sysible.com
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: sysible-platform-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sysible-cli
Description: first-boot installer for the Sysible platform apps
 Installs whichever Sysible platform apps were ticked on the installer's
 Optional-apps page. Each choice ships a marker file; this package provides the
 one-shot service that reads them on the first networked boot and runs
 install-sysible.
 .
 The work cannot happen in a maintainer script: install-sysible clones git
 repositories and builds containers, and a nested apt/dpkg call made from inside
 a running dpkg transaction aborts the parent run. The service is the only safe
 place for it, and it retries on each boot until it succeeds.

Package: sysible-app-slop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sysible-platform-installer
Description: install the Sysible platform behind the SLOP gateway (first boot)
 Selects the whole platform -- Controller, SLEP and Connect -- behind the SLOP
 gateway, so everything is reached through one front door on one origin,
 addressed by path. This is the recommended choice and supersedes the
 single-app packages: picking it alongside them installs the gateway only.

Package: sysible-app-controller
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sysible-platform-installer
Description: install Sysible Controller on the first boot
 Sysible Controller CE alone, on its own listener, without the SLOP gateway.
 Choose sysible-app-slop instead to have it fronted by the gateway.

Package: sysible-app-slep
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sysible-platform-installer
Description: install Sysible SLEP on the first boot
 The Sysible Linux Engineering Platform alone, on its own listener, without the
 SLOP gateway. Choose sysible-app-slop instead to have it fronted by the gateway.

Package: sysible-app-connect
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sysible-platform-installer
Description: install Sysible Connect on the first boot
 Sysible Connect alone, on its own listener, without the SLOP gateway. Choose
 sysible-app-slop instead to have it fronted by the gateway.
